     "anchor": "2.3-drv-atom-field-coupling"
    },
    {
     "id": "eq-2-85",
     "latex": "g_k = \\frac{\\mu}{\\hbar}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hbar\\nu_k}{2\\epsilon_0V}}",
     "anchor": "2.3-drv-spontaneous-emission-rate"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "transverse-fields-and-gauge",
   "kind": "idea",
   "section": "2.3",
   "name": "横场与规范",
   "terms": [
    "横场",
    "纵场",
    "规范",
    "正则动量"
   ],
   "statement": "对无源场的量子化只处理横场，从而避开矢势，相当于隐含地选定了一种规范；带有动量 p − qA/c 的正则哈密顿量是更一般的方法。"
  },
  {
   "id": "wigner-weisskopf",
   "kind": "result",
   "section": "2.3",
   "name": "维格纳-韦斯科普夫理论",
